{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 16 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">生理时序模型：门控、膨胀卷积、长状态与领域预训练</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Temporal Physiological AI</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_136_gru-title\">GRU</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">GRU 用 reset/update 两门和单一隐藏状态完成记忆更新，结构比 LSTM 更简洁。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Simplifies gated recurrence by merging cell and hidden states into a single vector h_t interpolated via an update gate z_t and a reset gate r_t.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">时间序列 xt 与上一隐藏状态 ht−1</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Sequential physiological or clinical feature vector x_t and previous hidden state h_{t-1}</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">当前隐藏状态 ht、全序列表示或逐时刻预测</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Updated hidden state h_t or sequence prediction</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figures 1 and 2 · PDF pp.2–3</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://aclanthology.org/D14-1179/\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_136_gru')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_136_gru')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"GRU original paper architecture figure, Figures 1 and 2\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/00958fd23a9b55326e37.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figures 1 and 2 · PDF pp.2–3</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 7 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_136_gru', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_136_gru\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_136_gru')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_136_gru', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_136_gru\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 07 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">xt 与 ht−1</span><span class=\"lang-en\">xt ht−1</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">当前观测和历史记忆</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests sequential physiological or clinical feature vector x_t and previous hidden state h_{t-1} and prepares initial tensor representations (xt ht−1).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"当前观测和历史记忆\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests sequential physiological or clinical feature vector x_t and previous hidden state h_{t-1} and prepares initial tensor representations (xt ht−1).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"xt 与 ht−1\" data-node-name-en=\"xt ht−1\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_136_gru', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">xt 与 ht−1</span><span class=\"lang-en\">xt ht−1</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">当前观测和历史记忆</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests sequential physiological or clinical feature vector x_t and previous hidden state h_{t-1} and prepares initial tensor representations (xt ht−1).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"sigmoid(Wr xt+Ur ht−1)，控制候选状态读取多少历史\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Reset gate rt to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"Reset gate rt\" data-node-name-en=\"Reset gate rt\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_136_gru', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Reset gate rt</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">sigmoid(Wr xt+Ur ht−1)，控制候选状态读取多少历史</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Reset gate rt to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"sigmoid(Wz xt+Uz ht−1)，控制保留旧状态与写入新候选的比例\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Update gate zt within the core dual gate recurrent unit computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"Update gate zt\" data-node-name-en=\"Update gate zt\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_136_gru', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Update gate zt</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">sigmoid(Wz xt+Uz ht−1)，控制保留旧状态与写入新候选的比例</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Update gate zt within the core dual gate recurrent unit computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"tanh(Wh xt+Uh(rt⊙ht−1))\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Candidate state h̃t within the core dual gate recurrent unit computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Candidate state h̃t\" data-node-name-en=\"Candidate state h̃t\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_136_gru', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Candidate state h̃t</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">tanh(Wh xt+Uh(rt⊙ht−1))</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Candidate state h̃t within the core dual gate recurrent unit computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"以 zt 在 ht−1 与 h̃t 之间逐维插值形成 ht\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Gated interpolation within the core dual gate recurrent unit computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Gated interpolation\" data-node-name-en=\"Gated interpolation\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_136_gru', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Gated interpolation</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">以 zt 在 ht−1 与 h̃t 之间逐维插值形成 ht</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Gated interpolation within the core dual gate recurrent unit computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"ht 传到下一时刻，参数跨时间共享\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Stage 06 to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"共享时间递归\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 06\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_136_gru', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">共享时间递归</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 06</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">ht 传到下一时刻，参数跨时间共享</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Stage 06 to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"读取最后状态、池化状态或逐时刻状态完成分类/预测\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces updated hidden state h_t or sequence prediction via sequence head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"序列任务 head\" data-node-name-en=\"sequence head\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_136_gru', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">序列任务 head</span><span class=\"lang-en\">sequence head</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">读取最后状态、池化状态或逐时刻状态完成分类/预测</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces updated hidden state h_t or sequence prediction via sequence head.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"GRU Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 更新门与重置门控制的时序状态递推</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Coupled Update Gate Interpolation h_t = (1−z_t) ⊙ h_{t-1} + z_t ⊙ h̃_t &amp; Reset Gate</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"GRU：核心公式 · 更新门与重置门控制的时序状态递推\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"136\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"10.719416pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.791958 -68.997244 487.55878 10.719416\" width=\"487.55878pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M4.744351-1.042169L4.61532-1.161274C4.079348-.486346 3.960242-.377166 3.801436-.377166C3.712107-.377166 3.642629-.456569 3.642629-.555824C3.642629-.665003 3.801436-1.280379 3.970168-1.796501C4.267931-2.72949 4.446588-3.463972 4.446588-3.712107C4.446588-4.109124 4.178602-4.37711 3.79151-4.37711C3.146358-4.37711 2.441653-3.731958 1.518589-2.282847L2.70964-6.729435L2.660012-6.779062C2.084338-6.650031 1.697247-6.580553 1.101722-6.511075V-6.362194C1.151349-6.362194 1.210901-6.362194 1.270454-6.362194C1.518589-6.362194 1.766725-6.342343 1.766725-6.123984C1.766725-5.895699 1.607918-5.379578 1.528515-5.081815L.188583 0H.932989C1.330006-1.528515 1.459037-1.865979 1.856053-2.47143C2.372175-3.255538 3.047104-3.870914 3.394494-3.870914C3.543375-3.870914 3.672405-3.751809 3.672405-3.622778C3.672405-3.583077 3.642629-3.454046 3.602927-3.295239L3.057029-1.240677C2.927999-.754332 2.858521-.446644 2.858521-.327539C2.858521-.069478 3.027253 .089329 3.295239 .089329C3.801436 .089329 4.1389-.178658 4.744351-1.042169Z\" id=\"m136_g13-17\"></path><path d=\"M7.592946-6.322492V-6.481299H5.617788V-6.322492C6.143835-6.272865 6.322492-6.163686 6.322492-5.865923C6.322492-5.707116 6.074357-4.7245 5.588011-3.017328L5.458981-2.530982C5.022262-.903213 4.387036-.228285 3.295239-.228285C2.47143-.228285 1.905681-.694779 1.905681-1.399484C1.905681-1.736948 2.203443-2.908148 2.878372-5.230696L2.927999-5.419279C3.136433-6.114059 3.2